2.2 Computed Fields (Per Cycle)
matchRate        = (matched + waived) / totalLineItems × 100
gapCount         = count(status IN [unmatched, disputed, remediation])
criticalGapCount = count(gapSeverity = 'critical')
riskScore        = weighted formula: 100 - (criticalGaps × 15) - (majorGaps × 5) - (minorGaps × 1)
auditReady       = riskScore ≥ 90 AND criticalGapCount = 0

