6.4 Auto-Match Algorithm
For each unmatched LineItem:
  1. Search Evidence Locker by requirementCode in filename/metadata
     → Exact code match = 95% confidence
  2. Search by domain + date range overlap
     → Domain match + date overlap = 70% base
  3. Search by responsible party + domain
     → Clinician match + domain = 65% base
  4. Brad AI semantic search (Evidence Locker contents vs requirement description)
     → Semantic similarity score mapped to 0-100

  Final confidence = max(all matching strategies)
  
  If confidence ≥ 85 → auto-matched
  If confidence 50-84 → flagged for review
  If confidence < 50 → unmatched

